 * when the cursor is in the right part we are always in command mode
 * ctrl-w (when in command mode) then (h) go left or (l) go right
+* visual selection works in command mode for the focused pane: (v) starts character selection, (V)
+    starts line selection, ctrl-v starts block selection, and (y)/(Y) copy the selected text
