diff --git a/docs/architecture.md b/docs/architecture.md
index 10718d2..2f661dd 100644
--- a/docs/architecture.md
+++ b/docs/architecture.md
@@ -305,6 +305,12 @@ When an agent chat is selected in command mode, `/` focuses the chat, seeds the
 `/`, and enters insert mode so `/status`-style input submits through the selected-agent backend
 command path.
 
+Command mode supports vim-style visual selection in both panes. `src/ui.rs::TerminalUi` starts
+character, line, and block selections with `v`, `V`, and `Ctrl-V`, moves the visual cursor with
+normal navigation keys, highlights selected text in the focused pane, and copies the selection with
+`y` or line-forced `Y`. Copied text is emitted through the terminal clipboard sequence and the status
+line reports the copied character count.
+
 The terminal app maps a session to a left-pane `READY` marker when the controller exposes no loading
 state for that session. `TerminalUi` queues one terminal bell when a chat transitions into the ready
 state and renders ready rows in reverse video so they remain highlighted until the chat becomes busy
